spans.s:
निवचने ind. Not speaking,
ceasing to speak, holding the tongue
(regarded as a गति or preposition, or
a separate word, when used with कृ;
e. g. निवचनेकृत्य, निवचने कृत्वा;

निवासिन् a.
1 Dwelling, residing.
--2 Wearing, dressed or clothed in;

.
--2 To declare or announce oneself;
कथमात्मानं निवेदयामि Ś. 1.
--3 To
indicate, betray, show;
शंकापीरग्रहनिवेदयिता

 To fix or direct
upon, apply to (as thought, mind
&c.);

.
--4 To
cause to settle in life, get married;
दौष्यंतिमप्रतिरथं तनयं निवेश्य Ś. 4. 19;

.
--7 To commit to writing, inscribe
on;

निविष्ट p. p.
1 Seated, sitting upon.
--2 Encamped;

.
--4 A house, an
abode, a dwelling;

निवृत्तिः f.
1 Returning or
coming back, return; Śi. 14. 64;

 To come back,
return; न च निम्नादिव सलिलं निवर्तते मे
ततो हृदयं Ś. 3. 1;

.
--3 To
turn away from, be averse to;

.
--2 To withdraw, keep away from;
turn away, divert;
